      `the court or chairperson may cause the accused to be removed and barred from re-entry, by s 672.5(10)(b)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 672.5(9) the accused has the right to be present during the whole of the hearing` MEANS
    IF `the court or chairperson may permit the accused to be absent, by s 672.5(10)(a)` EQUALS JUST TRUE OR `the court or chairperson may cause the accused to be removed and barred from re-entry, by s 672.5(10)(b)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Subject to subsection (10)"
    ELSE JUST TRUE

-- 672.5(11): any party may adduce evidence, make oral or written submissions, call witnesses and cross-examine any witness called by any other party and, on application, cross-examine any person who made an assessment report that was submitted to the court or Review Board in writing.
-- fork: F-GRANT-WHERE
-- src:13601 | (11) Any party may adduce evidence, make oral or written submissions, call witnesses and cross-examine any witness called by any other party and, on application, cross-examine any person who made an assessment report that was submitted to the court or Review Board in writing.
@ref s 672.5(11) (src:13601)
DECLARE `s 672.5(11) act` IS ONE OF
    `s 672.5(11) adduce evidence`
    `s 672.5(11) make oral or written submissions`
    `s 672.5(11) call witnesses`
    `s 672.5(11) cross-examine a witness called by any other party`
    `s 672.5(11) cross-examine a person who made an assessment report that was submitted in writing`
    `s 672.5(11) any other act`

-- fork: F-GRANT-WHERE
@ref s 672.5(11) (src:13601)
GIVEN `the person is a party` IS A BOOLEAN
      act IS A `s 672.5(11) act`
      `the party applies to cross-examine the person who made the assessment report` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 672.5(11) the party may do the act at the hearing` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the person is a party` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Any party may"
        IF act EQUALS `s 672.5(11) adduce evidence` OR act EQUALS `s 672.5(11) make oral or written submissions` OR act EQUALS `s 672.5(11) call witnesses` OR act EQUALS `s 672.5(11) cross-examine a witness called by any other party` THEN JUST TRUE
        IF act EQUALS `s 672.5(11) cross-examine a person who made an assessment report that was submitted in writing` AND `the party applies to cross-examine the person who made the assessment report` THEN JUST TRUE
        IF act EQUALS `s 672.5(11) cross-examine a person who made an assessment report that was submitted in writing` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "on application, cross-examine any person who made an assessment report that was submitted to the court or Review Board in writing"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "Any party may adduce evidence, make oral or written submissions, call witnesses and cross-examine"

